00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:16.276
<v News>地質遺産は、地球の歴史を知るために、大切な場所です。

00:06:16.975 --> 00:06:23.480
<v News>海の中の場所が選ばれたのは、今回が初めてです。

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:26.987
<v Host>Quiz time. Listen and answer.

00:06:27.588 --> 00:06:33.276
<v Slow>この地形は、何から名前をつけましたか。

00:06:34.076 --> 00:06:35.995
<v Host>From the monster Godzilla.

00:06:36.596 --> 00:06:43.555
<v Slow>この地形は、東京都の何倍ぐらいの大きさですか。

00:06:44.355 --> 00:06:46.228
<v Host>About three times.

00:06:46.827 --> 00:06:53.115
<v Slow>海の中の場所が選ばれたのは、初めてですか。

00:06:53.915 --> 00:06:56.196
<v Host>Yes, it is the first time.

00:06:56.795 --> 00:07:06.372
<v Host>That's all for this morning. Next time you look at the sea, remember there may be a monster sleeping at the bottom. Thanks for listening, and see you next time.

00:07:06.971 --> 00:07:09.372
<v News>また明日。
